  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSERVATION OF TWO PROPERTIES FOR NMB ON THE APPALACHIAN CORRIDOR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will acquire in fee 320 acres, and submit a request to the Government of Quebec to provide the acquired properties with the same protection status as the adjacent Montagnes-Vertes Nature Reserve. It will also reach out to the community to inspire other landowners to protect bird habitat.</narrative>
